    "id": "overlap-fb",
    "language": "[0]Okay, so in this scenario, my teammate has the ball right in front of me and, but there's a defender in front of my teammate. So, what I should do is create, um, a, is, is overlap and so that the teammate can pass the ball to me. Um, and then when I have the ball, I'll decide whether to go towards the goal, to shoot the, shoot the goal, or, um, pass it back to my teammate depending on h- how close the opponent is to me. So I'm gonna go wide right here[1] and then he's gonna pass.[2] [3][4](ball whooshing)[5] So n- I received the ball and the opponent is not too close to me and I have a clear line of shot to the goal, so I'm gonna make the shot to the goal. (ball whooshing)[6]",
